WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:38.339 --> 00:00:41.839
I said I was going to do something crazy at
50K.

00:00:41.839 --> 00:00:44.609
Hopefully that lived up to your expectations.

00:00:44.609 --> 00:00:48.329
HUGE, huge, huge thank you to you guys.

00:00:48.329 --> 00:00:53.379
I know I talked a lot about this on Twitter,
but big thank you to everybody who's supported

00:00:53.379 --> 00:00:54.379
me.

00:00:54.379 --> 00:00:57.079
Fifty K is just such a huge milestone.

00:00:57.079 --> 00:01:02.139
