already know what you look like, but hopefully

00:01:06.649 --> 00:01:08.079
this was entertaining for you.

00:01:08.079 --> 00:01:11.670
I know a lot of people wanted to see me shave
my beard for some reason.

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:16.810
