that is, but everybody really wants me to

00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:19.539
shave my beard so here, I'm gonna make you
guys a deal.

00:01:19.539 --> 00:01:25.770
If we can hit 100,000 subscribers, that is
twice what we have now by the end of the year,

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:29.369
I'm gonna go through with it and shave my
beard in a video.

00:01:29.369 --> 00:01:32.420
Just a couple updates on things going on around
the channel.

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:36.890
I know you guys have been waiting and waiting
for the new Al Dente Creepypasta.

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:41.439
