to see that.

00:01:41.439 --> 00:01:44.990
There is a new Al Dente Creepypasta coming
very very soon.

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:50.020
I think it's gonna be the best one yet,a nd
I've got some exciting collaborations lined

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:51.630
up for future episodes.

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:56.310
It should come as no surprise that I'm also
working on more Things You Missed, and we've

00:01:56.310 --> 00:02:00.259
