00:02:07.719 --> 00:02:10.670
And just in general, let me know what kind
of stuff you guys like to see.

00:02:10.670 --> 00:02:15.230
I've been experimenting a lot on the channel
and I want to make stuff that I like making

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:16.720
and you guys like watching.

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:20.720
The best way for me to do that is for me to
know what you guys like watching.

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:23.640
So head down in the comments and give me some
suggestions.

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:26.769
The next Deadstream is going to be August
27th.

00:02:26.769 --> 00:02:31.580
It's gonna be at the same time, it's 2PM pacific,
